    <string name="settings_detailed_title">swivi detaye</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">azout lekoutèr ar fil ek letan lamizik. android rapport bann evennman fil zis ar enn aplikasion ki pe marse, alor sa gard enn notifikasion silansie dan bar. bluetooth swiv kanmem.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">pa disponib ziska akse bluetooth done: sa version la deklar zis tip servis connectedDevice, ki android 14+ atas ar enn permision bluetooth.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">kont zis lamizik</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">statistik kont letan ki odio ti pe zwe vremem olie letan konekte. zis bann sesion anrezistre ar swivi detaye alime ti mezir lamizik; lezot pa konte.</string>
